  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "7.3.0: stable module names: Modules.GetPresentAsync (the modules present, hardware and software), client.JtagPorts (the JTAG ports, their state and XVC switch), DrummerTarget.GetPortAsync and BindPortAsync, CapabilitiesDto.Names. 7.2.0: client.Drummer: find the Drummer modules (FPGA instruments over JTAG) and run their operations (Target(prefix).CallAsync(\"MEM\", \"mem_start\", args)) as transactions on their Call channels, following long ones as jobs; status, info, attention, jobs, snapshots, field and semantic channels. Needs firmware with the resources.transact capability; otherwise the same as 7.1.0: https://github.com/esharpab/esharp-accordion-projects-webapiclient/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
